  "label": "Immigrants are mapped to sperm",
  "description": "The text 'they are like sperm' explicitly maps the visual entity 'crowd_interaction' (the group of people, likely immigrants or refugees) to the biological entity 'sperm'. This is a dehumanizing metaphor used to imply that while many arrive (like millions of sperm), only one will succeed or be useful, reducing human beings to biological statistics.",
